nty","/arc-plc/alabama/conecuh-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids in Conecuh County came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years for both May to June and September to October. In 2025, September to October ran 40% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, May to June on the middle came in at 215% of normal. Every grid listed had its driest year in 1954, and grid 13374 bottomed out at 50% that year.</p>"}
